      "statement": "All ten spec files assert component creation only — each compiles a component in TestBed and runs `expect(...).toBeTruthy()`. There is no automated E2E suite (no Cypress, Playwright, or equivalent); every behavioral flow is hand-verified via TEST-CASES.md.",
