      "id": "claim_785c3e1fa97c49da8d54f622a5cf7ffe",
      "statement": "The invitation page is a single unguarded Accept component served at both `/auth/activate` (new-user set-password flow) and `/invitations/accept` (existing-user login-then-accept flow). No guard is applied to either path because the invitee may be signed out or have no account yet.",
